---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="網站地圖 - 台灣教育處方籤"
  description="網站地圖"
  bodyClass="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800"
>
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main id="main-content" class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12">
        <!-- Page Hero Section -->
        <section class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                網站<span class="gradient-text">地圖</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                快速找到你想前往的頁面，一覽網站完整架構。
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Sitemap Grid -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">

            <!-- Column 1: 自主學習啟航站 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4"><a href="autonomous-learning/index.html" class="hover:underline">自主學習啟航站</a></h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="autonomous-learning/topic-ideas.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">主題靈感產生器</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">透過AI與策展，找到你的研究主題。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="autonomous-learning/plan-templates.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">計畫範本庫</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">參考優質範本，學習如何規劃。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="autonomous-learning/resource-map.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">學習資源地圖</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">精選全球最優質的線上學習資源。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="autonomous-learning/methodology.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">研究方法工具箱</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">學習文獻探討、問卷、訪談等方法。</p></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Column 2: 學習歷程煉金室 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-4"><a href="learning-portfolio/index.html" class="hover:underline">學習歷程煉金室</a></h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="learning-portfolio/portfolio-gallery.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">優質範例藝廊</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">觀摩跨學科的優質檔案與亮點分析。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="learning-portfolio/reflection-guide.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">反思引導提問集</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">透過提問與AI，深化你的學習心得。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="learning-portfolio/activity-database.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">多元表現資料庫</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">匯集全台的營隊、競賽與志工資訊。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="learning-portfolio/tools.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">線上製作工具箱</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">精選簡報、心智圖、筆記等實用工具。</p></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Column 3: 未來生涯GPS -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-4"><a href="career-exploration/index.html" class="hover:underline">未來生涯GPS</a></h3>
                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="career-exploration/clusters/index.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">十大學群升學指南</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">十大學群完整升學指南:科系定位、教授選才、多元表現、自主學習、迷思破解與備審面試。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="career-exploration/senior-interviews.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">學長姐真心話</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">閱讀來自各校系學長姐的真實經驗。</p></a></li>
                    <li><a href="career-exploration/competency-map.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">核心素養對照表</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">了解三面九項的內涵與實踐方法。</p></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Column 4: 公民科技、進階資源 & 其他 -->
            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-4">公民科技專案地圖</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                        <li><a href="civic-tech-map/index.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">專案與課綱對照表</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">g0v 公民科技專案對應 108 課綱素養與 SDGs。</p></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-pink-600 mb-4"><a href="advanced-resources/index.html" class="hover:underline">進階資源探索區</a></h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                        <li><a href="advanced-resources/online-courses.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">線上課程精選</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">精選 Coursera、edX 等頂尖課程。</p></a></li>
                        <li><a href="advanced-resources/competitions.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">國內外競賽資訊</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">匯集指標性競賽，挑戰自我。</p></a></li>
                        <li><a href="advanced-resources/reading-list.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">主題書單推薦</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">透過經典閱讀，建立知識體系。</p></a></li>
                        <li><a href="advanced-resources/open-education.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">開放教育資源</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">AI 實驗室、開放科學、開放課程與國際科學社群的開放資源。</p></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                 <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-700 mb-4">關於本站</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                        <li><a href="about.html" class="sitemap-link"><span class="font-semibold">關於我們</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">了解我們的使命、故事與團隊。</p></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>
    </main>

  <style is:global>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
        }
        .gradient-text {
            background: -webkit-linear-gradient(45deg, #6b7280, #111827);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .sitemap-link {
            display: block;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }
        .sitemap-link:hover {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
        }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
